{"v":15,"id":"e15","kid":"emma","title":"Dinner with My Host Family","zh":"和寄宿家庭共进晚餐","level":"A2","genre":"留学生活 · 故事","src":"original","sum":"张伟到波士顿参加夏令营，住在米勒家。第一顿晚餐他发现了很多不同：吃饭更早、各用各的盘子、要自己夹菜，饭后大家一起收拾。不同的习惯，同样温暖。","words":275,"paras":[{"t":"When Zhang Wei arrived in Boston for a summer program, he stayed with the Miller family: Mr. and Mrs. Miller, their twelve-year-old son Jake, and a big friendly dog named Biscuit.","w":[[0,4,"when",-1],[5,10,"Zhang",0],[11,14,"Wei",0],[15,22,"arrived",-1],[23,25,"in",-1],[26,32,"Boston",-1],[33,36,"for",-1],[37,38,"a",-1],[39,45,"summer",1],[46,53,"program",1],[55,57,"he",-1],[58,64,"stayed",-1],[65,69,"with",-1],[70,73,"the",-1],[74,80,"Miller",-1],[81,87,"family",-1],[89,92,"Mr",15],[93,96,"and",15],[97,101,"Mrs",15],[102,108,"Miller",15],[110,115,"their",-1],[116,131,"twelve-year-old",2],[132,135,"son",-1],[136,140,"Jake",-1],[142,145,"and",-1],[146,147,"a",-1],[148,151,"big",-1],[152,160,"friendly",-1],[161,164,"dog",-1],[165,170,"named",-1],[171,178,"Biscuit",-1]]},{"t":"On his first evening, Mrs. Miller called everyone to the table at six o'clock. Zhang Wei was surprised. At home in Chengdu, his family usually had dinner later, at around half past seven. He was also surprised by the food. There was a big bowl of salad, a plate of grilled chicken and some corn on the cob. Everyone had their own plate, and the dishes were passed around the table.","w":[[0,2,"on",-1],[3,6,"his",-1],[7,12,"first",-1],[13,20,"evening",-1],[22,26,"Mrs",-1],[27,33,"Miller",-1],[34,40,"called",-1],[41,49,"everyone",-1],[50,52,"to",-1],[53,56,"the",-1],[57,62,"table",-1],[63,65,"at",-1],[66,69,"six",-1],[70,77,"o'clock",-1],[79,84,"Zhang",0],[85,88,"Wei",0],[89,92,"was",-1],[93,102,"surprised",-1],[104,106,"at",-1],[107,111,"home",-1],[112,114,"in",-1],[115,122,"Chengdu",-1],[124,127,"his",-1],[128,134,"family",-1],[135,142,"usually",-1],[143,146,"had",-1],[147,153,"dinner",-1],[154,159,"later",-1],[161,163,"at",-1],[164,170,"around",-1],[171,175,"